  "rows": [
    {
      "key": "t36d53badf565e279",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Common Mistakes to Avoid When Selecting a Forex Broker</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">選擇外匯經紀商時要避免的常見錯誤</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t908229acd98cbcee",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Choosing only because of low spreads:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> A low advertised spread does not necessarily mean the lowest overall trading cost. Always compare commissions and additional fees.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">僅因為點差低而選擇：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">廣告上的點差低並不一定意味著總體交易成本最低。始終比較佣金和額外費用。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t08fa1b2608792640",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Finding a suitable forex trading provider is not simply about selecting the company with the lowest spreads or the highest leverage. It requires understanding the legal entity, regulatory permissions, account conditions, trading costs, platform features and potential financial risks.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">尋找合適的外匯交易提供商不僅僅是選擇點差最低或槓桿最高的公司。需要了解法人實體、監管許可、賬戶條件、交易成本、平臺特點和潛在的財務風險。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4b17680bad10decb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Take time to compare different providers, explore demo trading options and understand how each service works. Most importantly, remember that forex and CFD trading involve significant financial risks, and losses can exceed your initial investment in some circumstances.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">花時間比較不同的提供商，探索模擬交易選項並瞭解每種服務的工作原理。最重要的是，請記住，外匯和差價合約交易涉及重大財務風險，在某些情況下，損失可能超過您的初始投資。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te1d480e242fca64c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1. How can I choose reliable forex brokers in Abu Dhabi?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1。我如何在阿布扎比選擇可靠的外匯經紀商？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4c40541d043d1aaf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2. Is forex trading available in Abu Dhabi?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2。阿布扎比可以進行外匯交易嗎？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t317fd78cfcffc26c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Online forex trading services may be available to eligible Abu Dhabi residents, subject to local regulations, the provider's licensing arrangements and jurisdictional restrictions. Always confirm whether the specific entity and products are permitted for your circumstances.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">符合條件的阿布扎比居民可能可以使用線上外匯交易服務，但須遵守當地法規、提供商的許可安排和司法管轄區限制。請務必確認，根據您的具體情況，該實體及其產品是否獲准提供服務。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te875d86faf945a25",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">6. How much money is required to start forex trading with UPFOREX?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">6。使用 UPFOREX 開始外匯交易需要多少錢？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t03cec561e1e8b67d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">7. Are low spreads enough to identify a good forex broker?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">7。低點差是否足以識別優秀的外匯經紀商？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te0ee99243a97e0be",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">No. Spreads are only one part of the overall trading cost. Traders should also consider commissions, overnight financing, currency conversion and other applicable charges before comparing providers.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">不是。點差只是整體交易成本的一部分。在比較提供商之前，交易者還應考慮佣金、隔夜融資、貨幣兌換和其他適用費用。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td5a598e962dacf4f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">8. Can forex trading result in financial losses?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">8。外匯交易會導致經濟損失嗎？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta46aeab06a66905c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Yes. Forex and CFD trading involve market volatility and leverage-related risks. Traders can lose part or all of their invested capital, and derivative losses may exceed the original investment. Always understand the risks before trading.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">是的。外匯和差價合約交易涉及市場波動和槓桿相關風險。交易者可能損失部分或全部投資資金，衍生品損失可能超過原始投資。交易前始終瞭解風險。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t59d47ee75e34c917",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Risk Disclaimer:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> <span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">Forex and CFD trading</span> involve a high level of risk and may not be suitable for every investor. Leverage can magnify both gains and losses. Review all relevant legal documents, account terms and risk disclosures before proceeding. Consider obtaining independent financial, legal and tax advice. Never trade with money you cannot afford to lose.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">風險免責宣告：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> <span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">外匯和差價合約交易</span>涉及高風險，可能並不適合每個投資者。槓桿可以放大收益，也可以放大損失。在繼續操作之前，請檢視所有相關法律檔案、賬戶條款和風險披露。考慮獲取獨立的財務、法律和稅務建議。切勿用無法承受損失的資金進行交易。</span>"
    },
