      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">可用保證金：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">可用於開立額外頭寸或吸收損失的資金。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t15929aa864cbad54",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Equity:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Account balance adjusted for unrealised profits and losses.</span>",
